---
const effectiveDate = "2025-02-01";
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>Pin Privacy Policy</title>
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="styles.css" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg" href="graphics/pls_logo_white.png" />
  </head>
  <body>
    <header>
      <a href="/" class="full-portfolio-link">Home</a>
      <a href="/" id="homeButton">
        <img src="graphics/pls_logo.svg" alt="PLS Logo" />
      </a>
    </header>
    <main>
      <div class="bio-frame">
        <div class="bio-text-frame">
          <div class="name-line">pin privacy policy</div>
          <div class="bio-text-line">
            Effective date: {effectiveDate}
          </div>
          <div class="bio-text-line">
            This policy explains how PLS Studio ("we," "us") handles information
            when using our internal Pinterest pin workflow tool.
          </div>
          <div class="bio-text-line">
            What we collect: Pinterest account and board data you authorize,
            pin content you provide (images, titles, descriptions, links),
            and basic usage logs needed to operate the tool.
          </div>
          <div class="bio-text-line">
            How we use it: to create, edit, schedule, or publish pins on your
            behalf, and to improve our internal workflows.
          </div>
          <div class="bio-text-line">
            Sharing: we do not sell your data. We only share data with Pinterest
            via the Pinterest API to perform the actions you request.
          </div>
          <div class="bio-text-line">
            Storage and retention: data is stored only as long as needed to
            manage drafts, approvals, and publishing. You can request deletion
            of stored drafts or logs at any time.
          </div>
          <div class="bio-text-line">
            Security: we use reasonable technical and organizational safeguards
            to protect the information we store and transmit.
          </div>
          <div class="bio-text-line">
            Contact: if you have questions or requests, email
            contact@bryanammons.me.
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </main>
  </body>
</html>
